# PROJECT: BankEase — Banking, Made Easier
## Build a Complete, Professional, Responsive Banking Assistance Website

Act as a senior UI/UX designer, frontend engineer, and product designer specializing in premium fintech startups. Build a complete, polished, responsive website called **BankEase — Banking, Made Easier**.

The goal is to create an impressive, modern, professional website that simplifies banking procedures for everyday users, especially people who find digital banking complicated, struggle with banking terminology, have difficulty completing forms, or prefer voice-based assistance.

**Important: Build the complete frontend first. Do not require a bank backend, Supabase, or live bank integration for this initial version.** Implement the frontend interactions wherever possible, and clearly distinguish working features from simulated functionality.

Do not create only a landing page, a static UI mockup, or a generic AI chatbot template. Build the complete website with all the pages, navigation, forms, interactions, and responsive layouts described below.

